-- Sources: term.lth, kernel_models.lut, ebnf_model.lut and spec 3/11 at
-- 9fcc7e7096c72eae1b07d2f2b6aa51e14f4c8e05; prompt: record/IA/term-2026-10-13/codex-models.md.
-- Author: Codex, 2026-10-13. Deterministic, no seed; choices and law audit in codex.md.
-- Records/law update: term.lth at f421684 and 9a89873; user request v2, recorded in codex.md.
-- After-review sources: cc2542d and 2409c59; user request v3, recorded in codex.md.
-- Let/binder update: fe3bdab, 048cd55 and 23d23f4; user request v4, recorded in codex.md.
-- Constructor update: term.lth at 66d5cae; user request v5, recorded in codex.md.
